Package: nmSurvMed
Type: Package
Title: Causal Mediation Analysis for Non-Markov Multi-State Survival Models
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Li-Sheng",
    family = "Zhuang",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yspstcc100060507@gmail.com"
  )
Description: Estimates counterfactual hazards and time-varying direct and
    indirect effects in illness-death models without imposing a Markov
    assumption. Kernel-smoothed estimation, stratified cross-validation for
    bandwidth selection, and stratified bootstrap inference are provided.
    The methods are described in Zhuang, Yu, and Huang (2026)
    <doi:10.1002/sim.70685>, accepted for publication in Statistics in
    Medicine.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://doi.org/10.1002/sim.70685
SystemRequirements: Parallel execution uses forked processes on Linux and
    macOS and PSOCK workers on Windows.
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
